msgid ""
"How Automatic X-Ray handles its first build for a book. \"Ask each book\" "
"shows a one-time choice per book. \"Catch up, then follow\" quietly builds "
"checkpoints to your position and keeps one ahead. \"Build all checkpoints\" "
"offers the full checkpoint build with its cost confirmation. The ask "
"dialog's \"Always do this, for every book\" writes this setting too."
